<title>POLAND: NFI Kwiatkowski nets PLN 1.1 mln H1.</title>
<headline>NFI Kwiatkowski nets PLN 1.1 mln H1.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish National Investment Fund (NFI) Kwiatkowski (No. 9) preliminary results for the first half of 1997, in millions of zlotys:</p>
<p>					H1 1997		   H1 1996</p>
<p>  Net profit			  1.05			9.52 loss</p>
<p>  Investment portfolio	  360.89		    353.76</p>
<p>  Liabilities and provisions    1.93			2.32</p>
<p>  Net assets			369.05		    357.68</p>
<p>  Assets per share (PLN)	 11.89		     10.22</p>
<p>NOTE: The full company name is Narodowy Fundusz Inwestycyjny im Eugeniusza Kwiatkowskiego SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
